(7424440, 1171814, 114285, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by tanguera:</b></div><hr/><i> Delightful. The distant branches are like tendrils in the sky. A pity that a full third of the image at left is oof. Not much you can do about it with a shot like this except crop. </i></td></tr></table> Appreciate your comment, I did try to crop it, but it lost impact, and so crop I did not ;-)</td>', 'Originally posted by tanguera: Delightful. The distant branches are like tendrils in the sky. A pity that a full third of the image at left is oof. Not much you can do about it with a shot like this except crop.  Appreciate your comment, I did try to crop it, but it lost impact, and so crop I did not ;-)', '2015-12-28 03:37:27.000000', NULL, 0),
